{"unit_id":"tag:08L9:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为赋环空间（ringed space）。一个一阶增厚（first order thickening）<MATH_0002>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>平凡的（trivial）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果存在一个赋环空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）<MATH_0003>，它是<MATH_0004>的左逆（left inverse）。选择这样的态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>称为此一阶增厚（first order thickening）的一个<TEXTITOPEN_0002>平凡化（trivialization）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。给定<MATH_0006>，我们得到一个分裂（splitting）<MATH_0007>，它是<MATH_0008>上的代数（algebras）层（sheaves）的分裂，方法是利用<MATH_0009>分裂满射（surjection）<MATH_0010>。反过来，这样的分裂（splitting）确定一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>。<MATH_0012>的平凡化一阶增厚（trivialized first order thickenings）的范畴（category）等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0013>-模（modules）的范畴（category）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed space","target_term":"赋环空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡的"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"赋环空间的态射"},{"source_term":"left inverse","target_term":"左逆"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"trivialization","target_term":"平凡化"},{"source_term":"splitting","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"splitting","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"trivialized first order thickenings","target_term":"平凡化一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed space","target_term":"赋环空间","context":"给定空间，译法待决"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所述增厚，译法待决"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡的","context":"增厚的平凡性，译法待决"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"赋环空间